rbjson records facts about Riftbound cards: set codes, collector numbers, names and subtitles, card types,
domains, energy, power, might, tags, rarities and artists, and which gallery entry each printing is. No ability
text, flavour text or card art is copied into the data.

The facts come from Riot's official card gallery (https://playriftbound.com/en-us/card-gallery) and, for the
TCGplayer product ids and finishes, from TCGplayer's catalogue as mirrored by TCGCSV (https://tcgcsv.com). Card images in
the data are links to Riot's content delivery network, not copies. The images, card names and the Riftbound and
League of Legends marks belong to Riot Games. Anyone who displays them is responsible for having the right to.

rbjson is not endorsed by Riot Games and does not reflect the views or opinions of Riot Games or anyone
officially involved in producing or managing Riot Games properties.
